# attrs.ts

- Prefer `applyAttrs(identity, states, values, options?)` — do not take N boolean params.
- Define `*AttrStates` (boolean keys) next to the attrs helper when using `applyAttrs`.
- Export `*AttrStates` only when another module imports it (part `*.tsx`, sibling attrs, tests). Otherwise keep it file-local.
- **Identity:** `data-slot` is the component identity. Do **not** emit `data-<slot>` / `data-button`-style boolean markers.
- **Singles:** `applyAttrs("button", …)` → `data-slot` + state attrs.
- **Compounds:** `applyAttrs("scroll-area", …, { part: "root" | "content" | … })`:
  - `part: "root"` → `data-slot="<component>"` + `data-<component>-part="root"`
  - other parts → only `data-<component>-part="<part>"` (no `data-slot`)
- Internal/state-only: `dataAttrs(…, { statesOnly: true })` (no slot / part).
